From 5a86518999cf1a45d931b027e89bcc50bcb04016 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BellSoft <info@bell-sw.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:25:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Follow the module's Products table: any number of JDK and NIK
 families

osv-internal 0.5.5 replaces its EcosystemJDK/EcosystemNIK constants by the
Products table (a vendor may build the module with several JDK and NIK
families, and a family name may contain colons). osvecosystem recognises
every product family as valid and local-only (IsVendorProduct) and splits
an ecosystem string with the module's Family/Release; semantic picks the
JDK or NIK version grammar by the family's kind; the vendorjdk metadata
builds a purl from the family of the ecosystem. The tests use the first
family of each kind.
